  m_EditorClassIdentifier: TextStudio::TextStudio.TextStudioText
  _appearanceImages: []
  _appearanceFonts: []
  _textChangeLayoutDuration: 0
  _markup: '<textMagnifier>Drag the lens across these words. The letters grow beneath
    the glass, while their spacing bends gently around its edge.


    A tiny garden
    rewards a closer look: silver leaves, curled fern tips, and bright drops of rain.
    Even the smallest details have a story.


    This is one live text surface.
    Move the lens and watch the same letters change, without replacing or duplicating
    the paragraph.</textMagnifier>'
